" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:15.783" end="00:16.244">Though</span> <span begin="00:16.244" end="00:16.489">we've</span> <span begin="00:16.489" end="00:16.998">got</span><span begin="00:16.998" end="00:17.155">ta</span> <span begin="00:17.155" end="00:17.782">say</span> <span begin="00:17.782" end="00:18.088">good</span><span begin="00:18.088" end="00:20.213">bye</span> <span begin="00:20.213" end="00:20.632">for</span> <span begin="00:20.632" end="00:20.797">the</span> <span begin="00:20.797" end="00:21.358">sum</span><span begin="00:21.358" end="00:23.138">mer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">虽然我们不得不在这个夏天告别</span></p><p begin="00:23.709" end="00:27.417" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:23.709" end="00:24.887">Baby,</span> <span begin="00:24.887" end="00:25.247">I</span> <span begin="00:25.247" end="00:26.282">promise</span> <span begin="00:26.282" end="00:26.677">you</span> <span begin="00:26.677" end="00:27.417">this</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">宝贝，我向你保证</span></p><p begin="00:27.715" end="00:35.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:27.715" end="00:27.982">I'll</span> <span begin="00:27.982" end="00:28.417">send</span> <span begin="00:28.417" end="00:28.754">you</span> <span begin="00:28.754" end="00:29.152">all</span> <span begin="00:29.152" end="00:29.507">my</span> <span begin="00:29.507" end="00:31.199">love</span> <span begin="00:31.596" end="00:32.302">every</span> <span begin="00:32.302" end="00:33.023">day</span> <span begin="00:33.023" end="00:33.400">in</span> <span begin="00:33.400" end="00:33.755">a</span> <span begin="00:33.755" end="00:34.460">let</span><span begin="00:34.460" end="00:35.870">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我会每天在信里寄去我所有的爱</span></p><p begin="00:36.317" end="00:38.521" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:36.317" end="00:37.222">Sealed</span> <span begin="00:37.222" end="00:37.571">with</span> <span begin="00:37.571" end="00:37.926">a</span> <span begin="00:37.926" end="00:38.521">kiss</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">以吻封缄</span></p><p begin="00:38.552" end="00:45.414" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:38.552" end="00:39.022">Yes,</span> <span begin="00:39.022" end="00:39.327">it's</span> <span begin="00:39.327" end="00:40.032">gonna</span> <span begin="00:40.032" end="00:40.422">be</span> <span begin="00:40.422" end="00:40.712">a</span> <span begin="00:40.712" end="00:42.741">cold,</span> <span begin="00:42.741" end="00:43.163">lone</span><span begin="00:43.163" end="00:43.418">ly</span> <span begin="00:43.418" end="00:43.936">sum</span><span begin="00:43.936" end="00:45.414">mer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是的，这将是一个寒冷而寂寞的夏天</span></p><p begin="00:46.079" end="00:49.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:46.079" end="00:46.372">But</span> <span begin="00:46.372" end="00:47.060">I'll</span> <span begin="00:47.060" end="00:47.505">fill</span> <span begin="00:47.505" end="00:47.853">the</span> <span begin="00:47.853" end="00:49.133">empti</span><span begin="00:49.133" end="00:49.783">ness</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但我会填补那份空虚</span></p><p begin="00:50.130" end="00:58.259" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:50.130" end="00:50.410">I'll</span> <span begin="00:50.410" end="00:50.831">send</span> <span begin="00:50.831" end="00:51.208">you</span> <span begin="00:51.208" end="00:51.627">all</span> <span begin="00:51.627" end="00:51.928">my</span> <span begin="00:51.928" end="00:53.658">dreams</span> <span begin="00:53.992" end="00:54.807">every</span> <span begin="00:54.807" end="00:55.429">day</span> <span begin="00:55.429" end="00:55.774">in</span> <span begin="00:55.774" end="00:56.145">a</span> <span begin="00:56.145" end="00:56.869">let</span><span begin="00:56.869" end="00:58.259">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我会每天在信里寄去我所有的梦</span></p><p begin="00:58.769" end="01:02.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:58.769" end="00:59.684">Sealed</span> <span begin="00:59.684" end="00:59.994">with</span> <span begin="00:59.994" end="01:00.260">a</span> <span begin="01:00.260" end="01:02.337">kiss</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">以吻封缄</span></p><p begin="01:02.771" end="01:08.101" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:02.771" end="01:03.026">I'll</span> <span begin="01:03.026" end="01:03.896">see</span> <span begin="01:03.896" end="01:05.251">you</span> <span begin="01:05.251" end="01:05.586">in</span> <span begin="01:05.586" end="01:05.741">the</span> <span begin="01:05.741" end="01:06.664">sun</span><span begin="01:06.664" end="01:08.101">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我会在阳光里看见你</span></p><p begin="01:08.422" end="01:13.505" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:08.422" end="01:08.751">I'll</span> <span begin="01:08.751" end="01:09.422">hear</span> <span begin="01:09.422" end="01:10.062">your</span> <span begin="01:10.062" end="01:10.775">voice</span> <span begin="01:10.775" end="01:11.480">every</span><span begin="01:11.480" end="01:13.505">where</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我会在四处听见你的声音</span></p><p begin="01:13.865" end="01:19.002" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:13.865" end="01:14.216">I'll</span> <span begin="01:14.216" end="01:15.201">run</span> <span begin="01:15.201" end="01:15.564">to</span> <span begin="01:15.564" end="01:16.242">ten</span><span begin="01:16.242" end="01:16.553">der</span><span begin="01:16.553" end="01:16.973">ly</span> <span begin="01:16.973" end="01:17.667">hold</span> <span begin="01:17.667" end="01:19.002">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我会飞奔过去温柔地拥抱你</span></p><p begin="01:19.402" end="01:23.052" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:19.402" end="01:19.757">But</span> <span begin="01:19.757" end="01:21.208">baby,</span> <span begin="01:21.208" end="01:21.538">you</span> <span begin="01:21.538" end="01:22.072">won't</span> <span begin="01:22.072" end="01:22.485">be</span> <span begin="01:22.485" end="01:23.052">there</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可是宝贝，你却不在那里</span></p><p begin="01:23.170" end="01:29.651" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:23.170" end="01:23.537">I</span> <span begin="01:23.537" end="01:23.908">don't</span> <span begin="01:23.908" end="01:24.294">wan</span><span begin="01:24.294" end="01:24.469">na</span> <span begin="01:24.469" end="01:25.015">say</span> <span begin="01:25.015" end="01:25.320">good</span><span begin="01:25.320" end="01:27.305">bye</span> <span begin="01:27.305" end="01:27.790">for</span> <span begin="01:27.790" end="01:27.965">the</span> <span begin="01:27.965" end="01:28.581">sum</span><span begin="01:28.581" end="01:29.651">mer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不想在这个夏天说再见</span></p><p begin="01:30.671" end="01:34.202" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:30.671" end="01:31.571">Know</span><span begin="01:31.571" end="01:31.928">ing</span> <span begin="01:31.928" end="01:32.298">the</span> <span begin="01:32.298" end="01:33.306">love</span> <span begin="01:33.306" end="01:33.672">we'll</span> <span begin="01:33.672" end="01:34.202">miss</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">明知我们会错过这份爱</span></p><p begin="01:34.552" end="01:42.284" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:34.552" end="01:35.052">So</span> <span begin="01:35.052" end="01:35.397">let</span> <span begin="01:35.397" end="01:35.692">us</span> <span begin="01:35.692" end="01:36.057">make</span> <span begin="01:36.057" end="01:36.332">a</span> <span begin="01:36.332" end="01:37.421">pledge</span> <span begin="01:37.421" end="01:37.790">to</span> <span begin="01:37.790" end="01:38.472">meet</span> <span begin="01:38.472" end="01:38.712">in</span> <span begin="01:38.712" end="01:39.174">Sep</span><span begin="01:39.174" end="01:39.594">tem</span><span begin="01:39.594" end="01:42.284">ber</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以让我们约定在九月重逢</span></p><p begin="01:42.882" end="01:46.808" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:42.882" end="01:43.137">And</span> <span begin="01:43.137" end="01:43.657">seal</span> <span begin="01:43.657" end="01:43.921">it</span> <span begin="01:43.921" end="01:44.301">with</span> <span begin="01:44.301" end="01:44.549">a</span> <span begin="01:44.549" end="01:46.808">kiss</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">并以吻封缄</span></p><p begin="02:09.741" end="02:16.816" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:09.741" end="02:10.299">Yes,</span> <span begin="02:10.299" end="02:10.644">it's</span> <span begin="02:10.644" end="02:11.312">gonna</span> <span begin="02:11.312" end="02:11.677">be</span> <span begin="02:11.677" end="02:11.997">a</span> <span begin="02:11.997" end="02:14.082">cold,</span> <span begin="02:14.082" end="02:14.342">lone</span><span begin="02:14.342" end="02:14.582">ly</span> <span begin="02:14.582" end="02:15.131">sum</span><span begin="02:15.131" end="02:16.816">mer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是的，这将是一个寒冷而寂寞的夏天</span></p><p begin="02:17.162" end="02:20.928" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:17.162" end="02:17.473">But</span> <span begin="02:17.473" end="02:18.198">I'll</span> <span begin="02:18.198" end="02:18.548">fill</span> <span begin="02:18.548" end="02:18.898">the</span> <span begin="02:18.898" end="02:20.243">empti</span><span begin="02:20.243" end="02:20.928">ness</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但我会填补那份空虚</span></p><p begin="02:21.223" end="02:29.578" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:21.223" end="02:21.458">I'll</span> <span begin="02:21.458" end="02:21.873">send</span> <span begin="02:21.873" end="02:22.220">you</span> <span begin="02:22.220" end="02:22.626">all</span> <span begin="02:2